 "note": "CD74AC646 (Harris data, scanned): clocks CAB/CBA, output enable OE, bits A0-A7/B0-B7 (cd74ac646 p.1 terminal assignment: 1 CAB, 2 SAB, 3 DIR, 4-11 A0-A7, 12 GND, 13 B7 ... 20 B0, 21 OE, 22 SBA, 23 CBA, 24 VCC); same positions as 74_646. Function table cd74ac646 p.2 (646 column): Function table (all 646 PDFs): OE H = isolation (both ports read, registers still clock); OE L + DIR L: SBA L = real-time B to A, SBA H = stored B to A; OE L + DIR H: SAB L = real-time A to B, SAB H = stored A to B; CAB/CBA rising edge stores the A/B bus whatever OE/DIR are. Timing cd74ac646 p.5, VCC p.2.",
